---
/** 메인 첫 화면: 교회 사진 + 환영 문구 + 버튼 2개 (내용은 site.json 의 hero) */
import { site, mapsDirectionsUrl } from '../../data/site';
import ResponsiveImage from '../ResponsiveImage.astro';
const h = site.hero;
---
<section class="hero on-dark" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <ResponsiveImage class="hero__img" src={h.image} alt={h.alt} sizes="100vw" fetchpriority="high" loading="eager" decoding="async" />
  <div class="hero__scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="container hero__content">
    {h.eyebrow && <p class="hero__eyebrow">{h.eyebrow}</p>}
    <h1 id="hero-title" class="hero__title">{h.headline}</h1>
    {h.subline && <p class="hero__sub">{h.subline}</p>}
    <div class="hero__visit" aria-label="주일 방문 안내">
      {site.serviceTimes.slice(0, 2).map((s) => <p><strong>{s.name}</strong> <span>{s.time}</span></p>)}
      <a href={mapsDirectionsUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">{site.address}<span class="sr-only"> 길찾기 (새 창)</span></a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero__actions">
      <a class="btn btn-light btn-lg" href={h.primary.href}>{h.primary.label}</a>
      <a class="btn btn-outline-light btn-lg" href={h.secondary.href}>{h.secondary.label}</a>
      <a class="hero__english" href="/visit-en" lang="en">English visitor guide</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
